    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      568.94,
      526.44,
      584.21
    ],
    "text": "apparent that the suspect has been produced before the Magistrate Court of Matara on the 1st",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.039999961853027,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      591.57,
      370.75,
      604.85
    ],
    "text": "of February 2023 and held in remand custody up to this date.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      622.29,
      525.98,
      635.57
    ],
    "text": "The petitioner has made this application before us under section 83 of the Poisons, Opium",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      643.05,
      526.08,
      656.33
    ],
    "text": "and Dangerous Drugs (Amendment) Act, No.41 of 2022. As for the provisions of section",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      663.69,
      104.06,
      676.97
    ],
    "text": "83(2),",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      694.41,
      526.29,
      707.69
    ],
    "text": "\u201c83(2) notwithstanding the provisions of sections 84 and 85, a person suspected or",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      715.17,
      475.42,
      728.45
    ],
    "text": "accused of an offence under subsection (1) of section 54A and section 54B-",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      802.92,
      525.94,
      827.4
    ],
    "text": "Page 3 of 4",
    "fonts": [
      "Calibri",
      "Calibri,Bold"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      11.039999961853027
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      72.25,
      526.04,
      85.53
    ],
    "text": "(a) of which the pure quantity of the dangerous drug, trafficked, imported, exported,",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      92.89,
      526.32,
      106.17
    ],
    "text": "or possessed is ten grams or above in terms of the report issued by the Government",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      113.65,
      265.37,
      126.93
    ],
    "text": "Analyst under section 77A; and",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      144.37,
      526.09,
      157.65
    ],
    "text": "(b) Which is punishable with death or life imprisonment, shall not be released on bail",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      165.01,
      405.94,
      178.29
    ],
    "text": "except by the Court of Appeal in exceptional circumstances.\u201d",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      195.73,
      526.01,
      209.01
    ],
    "text": "The statute does not clarify what exceptional circumstances are. When granting bail to",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      216.49,
      526.06,
      229.77
    ],
    "text": "suspects under the Ordinance, our Superior Courts have taken into account a number of",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      237.16,
      278.35,
      250.44
    ],
    "text": "circumstances that qualify as exceptional.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      267.88,
      519.48,
      281.16
    ],
    "text": "In, Ramu Thamotharampillai V. The Attorney General [2004] 3 SLR 180, it was held that;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Bold",
      "Times New Roman,BoldItalic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      298.6,
      524.52,
      311.88
    ],
    "text": "\u201cthe decision must in each case depend on its own peculiar facts and circumstances.\u201d",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      329.32,
      495.0,
      342.6
    ],
    "text": "In, Labynidarage Nishanthi V. Attorney General CA (PHC) APN 48/2014), said that;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Bold",
      "Times New Roman,BoldItalic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      359.92,
      526.22,
      373.2
    ],
    "text": "\u201c\u2026the term \u201eexceptional circumstances\u201f has not been explained or defined in any of",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      380.68,
      526.1,
      393.96
    ],
    "text": "the statutes. Judges are given a wide discretion in deciding in what creates a circumstance",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      401.34,
      218.33,
      414.62
    ],
    "text": "which exceptional in nature.\u201d",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      432.06,
      526.4,
      445.34
    ],
    "text": "In, Welathanthrage Amila Sampath Botheju V. Attorney General CA/BAL/0239/23, it was",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman",
      "Times New Roman,Bold",
      "Times New Roman,BoldItalic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      452.82,
      120.02,
      466.1
    ],
    "text": "held that;",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      483.42,
      526.1,
      496.7
    ],
    "text": "\u201c\u2026a certain situation amounts to exceptional circumstances or not, has to be",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      504.18,
      468.1,
      517.46
    ],
    "text": "considered on a case-by-case basis, unique to each application before the court.\u201d",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      534.9,
      526.02,
      548.18
    ],
    "text": "When applied in relation to the facts before us, in paragraph 13 of the petition, the petitioner",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      555.54,
      526.37,
      568.82
    ],
    "text": "pleads that exceptional grounds pleaded by the counsel at the inquiry in addition to the",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      72.02,
      576.33,
      499.68,
      589.61
    ],
    "text": "grounds stated in the petition are alleged as exceptional grounds and they are as follows:",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      90.02,
      607.12,
      526.37,
      620.98
    ],
    "text": "- Nothing was recovered from the possession of the suspect and the heroin was",
    "fonts": [
      "Arial",
      "Calibri",
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      627.93,
      304.03,
      641.21
    ],
    "text": "introduced to him by the police officers.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      90.02,
      648.41,
      526.38,
      669.46
    ],
    "text": "- It is unjust for the suspect to be incarcerated in remand prison over a period of four",
    "fonts": [
      "Arial",
      "Calibri",
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      3.9600000381469727,
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      108.02,
      676.41,
      482.74,
      689.69
    ],
    "text": "months (by the time of filing this application) without serving an indictment.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times New Roman"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      12.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 2,
    "bbox": [
      90.02,
      696.99,
      526.09,
      719.02
    ],
    "text": "- The suspect has 12, 3, and 1 \u00bd years old children and the petitioner is burdened with",
    "fonts": [
      "Arial",
      "Calibri",
      "Times New Roman"
